# Project Overview

Tea inventory SaaS: stock, dashboard, owner-managed orders.

This checkout is the **`product`** line. `main` / `master` is a separate Mongo portfolio demo — do not merge the branches wholesale (ADR 003 / `product-git-workflow.mdc`).

## Roles (this branch)

- **owner** on both `personal` and `professional` editions. Owner uses the system alone.
- **Not now:** `admin`, `user`, `guest`, `customer`, `staff`.

See `product/product-overview.mdc` and `product/product-capabilities.mdc`.

## Tech Stack

**Frontend:** React 19, TypeScript 5.9, Vite, Tailwind CSS 4.3, i18n (`zh-TW` \| `en`)

**Backend:** Python, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Alembic, structured JSON logging, centralized API errors

**Database:** PostgreSQL only (`POSTGRES_URL`). Shared multi-tenant (`tenant_id`).

Assume intermediate TypeScript knowledge; explain advanced patterns when used.
